<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp raised at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp raised at Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said analyst Steve Fleishman raised the rating of PacifiCorp on both a near- and long-term basis on Friday.</p>
<p>-- stock was upgraded to near-term accumulate from neutral and raised to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 20-1/8 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
